# MediRescue AI - Environment Configuration

# Database Connection (PostgreSQL)
# Option A (Recommended - Instant & Free Cloud Database):
# 1. Go to https://neon.tech or https://supabase.com and create a free project.
# 2. Copy the connection string and paste it below:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://neondb_owner:password@ep-xyz-123.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"

# Option B (Local PostgreSQL):
# If running PostgreSQL locally on Windows or Docker:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app_db"

DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app_db"

# Optional: OpenAI API Key for advanced AI emergency chat triage (optional, rule-based fallback works without it)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=""

